  "term": "Bayesian",
  "definition": "Bayesian refers to a statistical approach to analyzing or combining research evidence. In this psychology research context, it describes a way of carrying out syntheses such as meta-analyses to estimate effects and evaluate how strongly the evidence supports them.",
